      ($cw$03.01.02$cw$, $cw$Access Enforcement$cw$, $cw$Enforce approved authorizations for logical access to CUI and system resources in accordance with applicable access control policies.$cw$, $cw$technical$cw$, $cw$1$cw$, false),
      ($cw$03.01.03$cw$, $cw$Information Flow Enforcement$cw$, $cw$Enforce approved authorizations for controlling the flow of CUI within the system and between connected systems.$cw$, $cw$technical$cw$, $cw$1$cw$, false),
      ($cw$03.01.04$cw$, $cw$Separation of Duties$cw$, $cw$a. Identify the duties of individuals requiring separation.
