      ($cw$FRL-CP-3$cw$, $cw$Contingency Training$cw$, $cw$a. Provide contingency training to system users consistent with assigned roles and responsibilities: 1. Within [time period] of assuming a contingency role or responsibility; 2. When required by system changes; and 3. [frequency] thereafter; and b. Review and update contingency training content [frequency] and following [events].

