IA-2 (1) Requirement: Multi-factor authentication must be phishing-resistant.

IA-2 (1) Guidance: Multi-factor authentication to subsequent components in the same user domain is not required.$cw$, $cw$technical$cw$, $cw$2$cw$, true),
      ($cw$FRL-IA-2(2)$cw$, $cw$Multi-factor Authentication to Non-privileged Accounts$cw$, $cw$Implement multi-factor authentication for access to non-privileged accounts.

