      ($cw$FRL-SR-10$cw$, $cw$Inspection of Systems or Components$cw$, $cw$Inspect the following systems or system components [at random | at [frequency] | upon [indications of need for inspection]] to detect tampering: [systems or system components].$cw$, $cw$technical$cw$, $cw$2$cw$, false),
