AU-11 Requirement: The service provider retains audit records on-line for at least ninety days and further preserves audit records off-line for a period that is in accordance with NARA requirements.
AU-11 Requirement: The service provider must either provide a capability for agency customers to export event log files so the agency can comply with federal log storage requirements from M-21-31; or store event log data on behalf of agency customers and make them available to agency customers in compliance with M-21-31. This additional requirement should be automatically updated if M-21-31 is rescinded, updated, or replaced.
