      ($cw$FRH-AC-14$cw$, $cw$Permitted Actions Without Identification or Authentication$cw$, $cw$a. Identify [user actions] that can be performed on the system without identification or authentication consistent with organizational mission and business functions; and b. Document and provide supporting rationale in the security plan for the system, user actions not requiring identification or authentication.$cw$, $cw$technical$cw$, $cw$2$cw$, false),
      ($cw$FRH-AC-17$cw$, $cw$Remote Access$cw$, $cw$a. Establish and document usage restrictions, configuration/connection requirements, and implementation guidance for each type of remote access allowed; and b. Authorize each type of remote access to the system prior to allowing such connections.$cw$, $cw$technical$cw$, $cw$2$cw$, false),
      ($cw$FRH-AC-17(1)$cw$, $cw$Monitoring and Control$cw$, $cw$Employ automated mechanisms to monitor and control remote access methods.$cw$, $cw$technical$cw$, $cw$2$cw$, true),
      ($cw$FRH-AC-17(2)$cw$, $cw$Protection of Confidentiality and Integrity Using Encryption$cw$, $cw$Implement cryptographic mechanisms to protect the confidentiality and integrity of remote access sessions.$cw$, $cw$technical$cw$, $cw$2$cw$, true),
      ($cw$FRH-AC-17(3)$cw$, $cw$Managed Access Control Points$cw$, $cw$Route remote accesses through authorized and managed network access control points.$cw$, $cw$technical$cw$, $cw$2$cw$, true),
