      ($cw$FRH-AC-18(5)$cw$, $cw$Antennas and Transmission Power Levels$cw$, $cw$Select radio antennas and calibrate transmission power levels to reduce the probability that signals from wireless access points can be received outside of organization-controlled boundaries.$cw$, $cw$technical$cw$, $cw$2$cw$, true),
